      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RAPID LULU (1) was fast away from wide out with an impressive early sectional and went on to clock 19.92 in a one length win at this track over 352m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from four attempts. Looks to have an edge on most of these. COALMAN JACK (2) comes off an average effort last start when sixth at this track over 352m behind Shimmering Reign (20.36) in a Mix 5. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from eight attempts. Expected to feature in the finish. SPRING NICK (7) last start finished 3rd in a Mix 5 on July 31 over 390m at this track behind Strikes Twice beaten 4 lengths (22.18). Looks a key player on best form. GO GO CAMBLA (8) was in the money again last time and not beaten far when second (19.99) at this track in a Mix 5.",
